  message: "Implemented in PR #1615 (b53ac16880). supply_chain_summary.vendored_analysed = {dirs, entries: [{path, languages, files}]} (cap 10) from tier-3 file nodes grouped by supply_chain.vendored_root (the directory the EXTERNAL_DEP pattern matched); stderr line + sketch Overview line via format_vendored_disclosure; nothing printed when none. Behavioural evidence, production-path test test_vendored_code_is_disclosed_on_stderr_in_the_artifact_and_the_sketch (mainstream package; real run_survey over main.go + third_party/lib/helper.c): stderr contains 'Vendored third-party code analysed as tier 3, not counted in the language breakdown: third_party/ (c; 1 file). To skip: --exclude <dir>.', the artifact's vendored_analysed is {dirs: 1, entries: [{path: third_party, languages: [c], files: 1}]}, and generate_sketch(cached_results=bm) contains the same line; test_no_vendored_disclosure_without_vendored_code: native/helper.c gives no line. Not run on the self-tree. Text differs from the proposal only in the parenthetical ('c; 1 file' -- analyzer language names, not 'C/C++')."  # 2034
